From: RenkuOS GPU Development <gpu-development@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:03:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] intel_extreme: add Type-C power ownership lifecycle

---
 .../intel_extreme/TypeCPowerLifecycle.h       | 95 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 95 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCPowerLifecycle.h

diff --git a/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCPowerLifecycle.h b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCPowerLifecycle.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..859ab749
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCPowerLifecycle.h
@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@
+/*
